{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>EarnIt Time and Allowance 把日常家務與孩子真正重視的回報連繫起來，完成家務可換取當日的屏幕時間，或每週的零用錢。家長全程掌握審批與設定，孩子則看到一份清晰的家務清單，適合希望以正面獎勵取代不斷催促的家庭。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>家長審批的家務獎勵機制</h2>\n<p>家長建立家庭並加入孩子，設定每日屏幕時間上限；孩子選擇家務、在現實中做完後標記完成，分鐘數與零用錢須經家長審批才會入帳。四位數家長 PIN 保護審批與設定，家長可批准或拒絕家務及調整上限。App 只記錄已賺取的屏幕時間，不會鎖定裝置或改動系統設定。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-497-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-498-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-499-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-500-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-501-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-502-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：EarnIt Time and Allowance</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T07:58:01.101540+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":338,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}